        "mods": {
          "max": 7,
          "current": 0,
          "list": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">A Pipe Gun can accept one each of the following mods. Any Stock mods replace &ldquo;Gun&rdquo; with &ldquo;Rifle&rdquo; in the weapon&rsquo;s name.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><strong>Receiver:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.lZXmmJghkwx2Cfth]{Calibrated Receiver}, </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">@Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.6BSZSiI20H86MtAb]{Hardened Receiver}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.WCJ0QR5lOk9qBuxo]{Automatic Receiver}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.pNv4YuXn6LxkcLnj]{Hair Trigger}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.7EV6l9KqHJ6KJpQi]{Powerful Receiver}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.xpx4QLnLKMjjXuWV]{.45 Receiver}</span></p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">Barrel:</span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">@Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.6py6TtlkeywhWQl1]{Long Barrel}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.cvoae6Grdf6NGVM4]{Ported Barrel}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.RX5rg3JRCwjafiWN]{Finned Barrel}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><strong>Grip:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.oFXs4w5msufzhIVI]{Sharpshooter's Grip}</span><br style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto;\" /></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Stock: </strong>@Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.Xiya2cq2V9TZ0UFC]{Standard Stock}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.GcvxfPv8mm8bpxM7]{Marksman's Stock}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.esTu2kHbvyxBdSFV]{Recoil Compensating Stock}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Magazine: </span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle0\">@Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.COx7kAmBX5tY55ty]{Large Magazine}</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.lcYV8De9jKX8legK]{Quick-Eject Magazine}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.eTh6sOdMe4xVwPOj]{Large Quick-Eject Magazine}</span><br style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto;\" /></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Sights:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.WZAnlfreDNUAaX4Y]{Reflex Sight}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.9IW2T8sgBoIzzxn8]{Short Scope}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.0mBcFGCDPdhVRPsP]{Long Scope}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.aQLTpQYLnuRen9xP]{Short Night Vision Scope}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.HXoyLcCUhPOtbnse]{Long Night Vision Scope}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.K8ZOSxg9heUurjsM]{Recon Scope}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Muzzle:</strong></span><span class=\"fontstyle0\"> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.cjhhUXRxUhsF8kUZ]{Bayonet}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.yc9XrK9oHlAwskcS]{Compensator},&nbsp; @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.G8G71ZleOMUrMWSK]{Muzzle Brake}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.pjfCBe11xshHLSZP]{Suppressor}</span></p>"
        }
